E AX3119 1282-asm-options.ax:29:32-36 asm-options "a `pure` block's only effect is its outputs, and this arm has none; drop `pure`, or add the output it computes" !"run `axiom explain AX3119` for the full form" ?"`pure` lets the optimiser drop a block whose outputs go unused, so it needs an output and `nomem` or `readonly`; `noreturn` takes no outputs; `att_syntax` and `intel_syntax` are x86_64's; with `clobber_abi` each output names its register"
